Creative Commons Zero v1.0 Universal

The Creative Commons CC0 Public Domain Dedication waives copyright
interest in a work you've created and dedicates it to the world-wide
public domain. Use CC0 to opt out of copyright entirely and ensure your
work has the widest reach. As with the Unlicense and typical software
licenses, CC0 disclaims warranties. CC0 is very similar to the Unlicense.

The full text of the CC0 1.0 Universal license can be found at:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode
